Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.91,0:00:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I just have to explain\Nit to the rest of the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, we'd like a temporary\Nleave of absence from the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.33,0:00:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have concerns with the current state\Nof the guild, and we need time to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, I'm positive you won't stay\Naway from the battlefield for long.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.24,0:00:38.74,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(991.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H10241F&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&}October {\fscx110}25{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}     {\fscx110}22{\fscx95}nd Floor
