Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This view is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.33,0:00:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is pretty awesome, but\Ndon't fall off the balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would really suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.57,0:00:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We bought the best house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.15,0:01:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we're totally broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worth it, though, because\Nwe can live in peace here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.39,0:01:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.79,0:01:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I was thinking, does our\Nrelationship only exist in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.55,0:01:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn if\Nthis is a virtual world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My feelings for you are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I learned anything in the\Nlast two years, it's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.93,0:01:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To keep doing the best\Nwe can till the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.73,0:01:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we make it back to the real world,\NI promise I'm going to find you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.61,0:01:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And fall in love with you again.
