Dialogue: 3,0:03:22.99,0:03:26.99,title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.75\clip(0,813,1920,816)\pos(960,825)\c&HCEA819&}The Girl Of The Morning Dew
Dialogue: 3,0:03:22.99,0:03:26.99,title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.75\clip(0,816,1920,819)\pos(960,825)\c&HCEA818&}The Girl Of The Morning Dew
Dialogue: 3,0:03:22.99,0:03:26.99,title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.75\clip(0,819,1920,822)\pos(960,825)\c&HCEA717&}The Girl Of The Morning Dew
Dialogue: 3,0:03:22.99,0:03:26.99,title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.75\clip(0,822,1920,825)\pos(960,825)\c&HCEA616&}The Girl Of The Morning Dew
Dialogue: 3,0:03:22.99,0:03:26.99,title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.75\clip(0,825,1920,828)\pos(960,825)\c&HCEA616&}The Girl Of The Morning Dew
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.89,0:03:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usually he's brash and impulsive,\Nbut he can be so naive, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.19,0:03:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost like a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, is he younger than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.39,0:03:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stay together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't hear a thing. What'd\Nyou say? Nothing! Not a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you want to go\Nhave some fun today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.03,0:04:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you know, didn't\Nwe have fun yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the day before, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.27,0:04:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're saying you don't\Nwant to go have fun today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know a place we can go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:04:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:05:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just gonna have to wait\Ntill we get there to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.59,0:05:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, carry me on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.01,0:05:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.92,0:05:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, it's no fun seeing the\Nworld from the same height all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.07,0:05:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, with your strength\Nparameter, you won't break a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, I guess, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.19,0:05:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you a little old for that, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how old I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.09,0:05:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's not like\Nanyone's gonna see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you turn around, I'm gonna slap you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna hop on already or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giddy up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.85,0:05:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so cool, you can\Nalready see the lake from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can see the lake, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.41,0:05:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if you want, you can\Nride on my shoulders later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.35,0:06:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get a move on, horsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're heading north-northeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It almost blew up my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got people staring at us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our own audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.45,0:06:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, wave back or\Nhe'll think you're rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.39,0:06:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to get off you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.89,0:06:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're fine right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard this weird rumor\Nin the village yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About how if you go deep enough\Ninto the forest, you'll see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See who?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ghosts You mean like those in-game\Nastral type monsters, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not those.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say the tortured souls\Nof the monsters hunted here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come back to wander the forest at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.85,0:07:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The place the rumor mentions?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.71,0:07:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About a week ago, a carpenter hiked into\Nthe forest to get some wood for a project.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stayed so long that before\Nhe knew it, it was night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.91,0:07:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As he walked along, he caught a glimpse\Nof something white standing by a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.59,0:07:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it a monster or something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.99,0:07:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The white figure slowly\Nwalked towards some trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.05,0:07:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.13,0:08:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.31,0:08:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.17,0:08:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.37,0:08:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.99,0:08:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.07,0:08:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, get it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.49,0:08:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's another player.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:09:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but there's something\Nreally strange about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.57,0:09:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have a cursor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's some kind of bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.49,0:09:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a little girl like\Nthis doing playing SAO?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll find out when she wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.97,0:09:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can't just leave\Nher out here till she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.71,0:09:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take her home with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.63,0:09:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.05,0:09:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, one thing's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not an NPC.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't have any\Ntrouble moving her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.37,0:09:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can't be that. If she were,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she would have given off a warning when\Nyou picked her up, like other NPCs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.37,0:09:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she's definitely not\Na quest giver either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our quest log would have been updated\Nas soon as we interacted with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.27,0:09:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has to be a player.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.23,0:10:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'd probably been out there for\Na while, wandering around, lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.07,0:10:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the most likely scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.77,0:10:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what was she doing out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.53,0:10:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your guess is as good as mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.47,0:10:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she has to have a parent\Nor guardian out there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.93,0:10:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.84,0:10:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She had to have logged in\Nwith someone from her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.21,0:10:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope they're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think she'll wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if her body hasn't disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that means signals are still being\Ntransmitted to and from her nerve gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.53,0:10:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in some kind of sleep mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll wake up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.65,0:10:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the sooner the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.43,0:10:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder, did she log into SAO\Nby herself, or with her family?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or has she been alone here, all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sleep well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please hurry and wake up tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.47,0:11:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.53,0:11:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.51,0:11:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You woke up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.89,0:12:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.95,0:12:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.51,0:12:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.91,0:12:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and this is Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.77,0:12:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you doing in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.75,0:12:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do you know where\Nyour mom and dad are now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.97,0:12:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.95,0:12:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.89,0:13:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I call you, Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.07,0:13:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.07,0:13:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then you can call me Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you say Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.59,0:13:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kirito. Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.59,0:13:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.65,0:13:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a little hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you call me\Nwhatever's easier for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.53,0:13:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.03,0:13:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.91,0:13:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, nice. It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.61,0:13:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.59,0:13:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm Mommy. That works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.55,0:13:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy! Mommy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.81,0:13:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now about breakfast. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.05,0:14:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Yui. This one's yours
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.85,0:14:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.57,0:14:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's super spicy I want\Nthe same one that Daddy has.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.37,0:14:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if you think you're\Nready for it, I won't stop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.95,0:14:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only live once, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.97,0:14:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.55,0:14:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you've got an iron stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can do a full course of extra\Nspicy food tonight if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.37,0:14:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.31,0:14:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's not get carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not cooking anything nuclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.81,0:14:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard the lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard the lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.25,0:15:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a blank slate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.93,0:15:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.29,0:15:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.23,0:15:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.19,0:15:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like she's a baby again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.03,0:15:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.71,0:15:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.99,0:15:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.61,0:15:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least, until she gets her memory back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.53,0:15:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.44,0:15:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's a catch-22.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get back and clear the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.73,0:15:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, it'll take that much\Nlonger for Yui to be free of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.71,0:15:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, we'll do what we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging by the gear she's got in her storage,\NShe hasn't been out in the field much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.09,0:15:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll check the Town of Beginnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe there we can find\Nout if she's got family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.99,0:15:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't want to say\Ngoodbye to her either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we just met her and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But having her here, it's made our\Nlittle cabin feel like a real home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.63,0:16:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.81,0:16:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't mean we'll\Nnever see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But look, if she's got a family out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're probably worried\Nabout her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, when she wakes up, we'll\Ngo to the Town of Beginnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.17,0:16:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That place is army territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be a good idea if we go in\Nfully equipped, ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.33,0:16:51.34,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,479)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\c&H121212&\4c&H363A3A&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&\pos(960,945)}October {\fscx110}31{\fscx95}st, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}  1st Floor • Town Of Beginnings
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.33,0:16:51.34,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,479)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\c&H121212&\4c&H363A3A&\blur3\fs72\alpha&65\pos(960,945)}October {\fscx110}31{\fscx95}st, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}  1st Floor • Town Of Beginnings
Dialogue: 2,0:16:47.33,0:16:51.34,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,479)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\pos(960,942)}October {\fscx110}31{\fscx95}st, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}  1st Floor • Town Of Beginnings
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.87,0:16:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been forever since\NI've been back here. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.53,0:17:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do any of these buildings look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.55,0:17:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.65,0:17:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get down about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Town of Beginnings\Nis a really big place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.77,0:17:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we start at the Central Market?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.41,0:17:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know how many players are here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.23,0:17:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now in the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.09,0:17:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, there were 6,000\Nplayers still alive in SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And about 30 % of those people, including\Nthe army, live in the town of Beginnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.13,0:17:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So maybe a little less than 2,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.77,0:17:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then doesn't it seem a\Nlittle dead around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.61,0:17:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave those children alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that daycare bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.09,0:17:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.69,0:17:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone and let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You make it sound like we're doing\Nsomething illegal, Baby Cakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just teaching them\Nhow things work around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.59,0:18:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making sure they pay their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.51,0:18:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all part of the Army's job, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.11,0:18:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's got to pay taxes around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.09,0:18:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gin! Cait! Main! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.65,0:18:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me, Sasha! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.83,0:18:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just want your money, so\Ngive it to them and it'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We tried, Teach, but they\Nsaid it's not good enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.11,0:18:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you deadbeats owe us\Na hell of a lot in back taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.61,0:18:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to drop all the equipment you\Ngot right there, including your armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.59,0:18:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, honey, don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.53,0:18:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.69,0:18:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me through or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.69,0:18:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.89,0:18:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are gonna be okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.59,0:18:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pick up your stuff, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.99,0:19:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is army business, so\Nget the hell out of our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're all new in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, cuz we're with the Liberation\NArmy, and you do not mess with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.65,0:19:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, take care of Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.57,0:19:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.43,0:19:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a safe zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.47,0:19:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your HP won't deplete no matter what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:19:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just a feeling of\Ngetting knocked off your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.23,0:20:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, a fight with me is still\Ngoing to scare the hell out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stand there, you assholes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.41,0:20:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.45,0:20:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.19,0:20:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.85,0:20:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.76,0:20:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.63,0:20:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.73,0:20:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.37,0:20:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mom's crazy strong, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their hearts...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.47,0:21:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's hearts are...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.91,0:21:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.27,0:21:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.75,0:21:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.66,0:21:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.93,0:21:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.63,0:21:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui, did you remember something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.35,0:21:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.26,0:21:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was never here...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this place...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was always alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the dark...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.19,0:21:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.63,0:21:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.95,0:21:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.03,0:21:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.31,0:22:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
